```html
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
 <meta charset="UTF-8">
 <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
 <style>
 body {
 font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
 margin: 0;
 padding: 0;
 display: flex;
 justify-content: center;
 align-items: center;
 height: 100vh;
 background-color: #f4f4f9;
 }
 .contact-form {
 background: #fff;
 padding: 2rem;
 box-shadow: 0 0 10px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);
 max-width: 600px;
 width: 100%;
 box-sizing: border-box;
 }
 .form-group {
 margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
 }
 label {
 display: block;
 margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
 font-weight: bold;
 }
 input[type="text"],
 input[type="email"],
 textarea {
 width: calc(100% - 2px);
 padding: 0.5rem;
 border: 1px solid #ccc;
 border-radius: 4px;
 box-sizing: border-box;
 }
 input[type="submit"] {
 background-color: #007bff;
 color: #fff;
 border: none;
 padding: 0.75rem 1.5rem;
 border-radius: 4px;
 cursor: pointer;
 transition: background-color 0.3s;
 }
 input[type="submit"]:hover {
 background-color: #0056b3;
 }
 </style>
</head>
<body>
 <form class="contact-form">
 <div class="form-group">
 <label for="name">Name</label>
 <input type="text" id="name" name="name" required>
 </div>
 <div class="form-group">
 <label for="email">Email</label>
 <input type="email" id="email" name="email" required>
 </div>
 <div class="form-group">
 <label for="message">Message</label>
 <textarea id="message" name="message" rows="5" required></textarea>
 </div>
 <input type="submit" value="Send">
 </form>
</body>
</html>
```

### Key Features of Responsive Design:
- **Viewport Meta Tag**: Ensures the layout adapts to different screen sizes by setting the viewport's width to the device's width.
- **Flexbox**: Used for aligning items centrally on the page.
- **Width Adjustments**: Input fields use `calc(100% - 2px)` to maintain full width while accounting for borders, enabling a seamless fit inside container boundaries.
- **Media Queries**: Although not featured here, media queries can further refine styles for specific screen sizes.

This form is simple but effective at resizing based on screen width. It encourages a fluid layout which is great for user experience on any device.

