 <section id="about"><h1>About Us</h1></section>
 <section id="services"><h1>Services</h1></section>
 <section id="contact"><h1>Contact Us</h1></section>
 </main>
 <script>
 function toggleNav() {
 const nav = document.querySelector('nav');
 nav.classList.toggle('active');
 }
 </script>
</body>
</html>
```

**Key Features:**
1. **Sticky Navigation:** The header sticks to the top of the viewport using `position: sticky`.
2. **Responsive Design:** The navigation menu is hidden on smaller screens and can be toggled with a button.
3. **Accessibility Improvements:** Keyboard focus is made visible on links for improved accessibility.

